24:48</ref> 2 masculine singular suffix <bdbheb>הִנְחִתָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 9:12\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(16,9,12)\">Neh 9:12</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> suffix <bdbheb>יַנְחֵ֫נִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 23:7\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(4,23,7)\">Num 23:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 23:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,23,3)\">Ps 23:3</ref> <bdbheb>יַנְחֶ֫נּוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 32:12\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,12)\">Deut 32:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 18:16\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(20,18,16)\">Prov 18:16</ref> 3 feminine singular <bdbheb>תַּנְחֶה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 6:22\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(20,6,22)\">Prov 6:22</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Infinitive construct</highlight> suffix <bdbheb>לְהַנְחֹתָּם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 9:19\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(16,9,19)\">Neh 9:19</ref> <bdbheb>לַנְחֹתָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 13:21\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(2,13,21)\">Exod 13:21</ref> — <highlight>lead, guide</highlight> (= Qal) followed by accusative of person <ref ref=\"Num 23:7\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(4,23,7)\">Num 23:7</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; + <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb>). — <ref ref=\"1Sam 22:4\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(9,22,4)\">1Sam 22:4</ref> (+ <bdbheb>אֶתפְּֿנֵי</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"1Kgs 10:26\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(11,10,26)\">1Kgs 10:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 18:11\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"1